# The staging hub's site, appended to the Caddyfile on a server that runs one; see
# docs/HUB.md. Its own name, so the staging reader app has its own origin (its own
# Service Worker, storage and sign-ins on a phone) and never mixes with production's.
# The name comes from SHELFGAUGE_STAGING_DOMAIN in Caddy's environment, or replace the
# placeholder with it. The same name goes into the staging hub's `allowed_hosts`.

{$SHELFGAUGE_STAGING_DOMAIN} {
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8744
}
